DRAFT / NOT FOR FABRICATION / FOOTPRINTS & ERC PENDING", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.11811, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie116", "X": 1000, "Y": -180, "Content": "MIC1  TBD analog MEMS", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 6.29921, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie117", "X": 1000, "Y": -200, "Content": "TBD / NO PHYSICAL PIN NUMBERS / NO FOOTPRINT", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 4.33071, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie177", "X": 1685, "Y": -175, "Content": "J4  SPEAKER CONTACTS", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 6.29921, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie178", "X": 1685, "Y": -195, "Content": "TBD / NO PHYSICAL PIN NUMBERS / NO FOOTPRINT", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 4.33071, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie427", "X": 100, "Y": -1410, "Content": "ES8311 Rev 5.0 recommended supply: DVDD/PVDD 1.6-3.6 V, AVDD 1.7-3.6 V, absolute max 3.6 V; hold +3V3_SYS inside 3.0-3.6 V or the codec keeps no headroom.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie428", "X": 100, "Y": -1430, "Content": "ES8311 Rev 5.0 documents no mic bias or electret supply pin; the MIC1N reference and the mic bias network stay TBD with the microphone selection.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie429", "X": 100, "Y": -1450, "Content": "Codec I2C address is 0011 00x, CE strapped low gives 0x18; no clash with BMI270 0x68, RV-3028-C7 0x51/0x52, MAX17048 0x36 or DRV2605L 0x5A.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie430", "X": 100, "Y": -1470, "Content": "ES8311 in slave mode expects externally supplied SCLK/LRCK; in master mode both derive from MCLK. Clock direction and ESP32 I2S feasibility remain unvalidated.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie431", "X": 100, "Y": -1490, "Content": "PAM8302A delivers 0.72 W min / 0.80 W typ into 8 ohm at VDD=3.6 V and 10% THD+N; 1 W from a 3.3 V rail is not achievable. A 1 W speaker rating is not delivered power.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie432", "X": 100, "Y": -1510, "Content": "Amp VDD drafted on VBAT (2.0-5.5 V allowed, SHDN must stay within VDD+0.3 V); +3V3_SYS and SYS stay open options - confirm cell impedance and peak current with the pack data.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie433", "X": 100, "Y": -1530, "Content": "SHDN releases through R601/C614 for a datasheet 1-100 ms delay after VBAT rises; no spare GPIO exists for explicit enable control.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie434", "X": 100, "Y": -1550, "Content": "One 220 nF cap per side merges the ES8311 output coupling with the PAM8302A CI 0.1-0.22 uF requirement; corner against the internal 10 k is about 72 Hz.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie435", "X": 100, "Y": -1570, "Content": "Filterless BTL: never reference SPK_P or SPK_N to ground, keep the pair short, and add the datasheet ferrite-bead filter when the runs exceed 20 cm.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie436", "X": 100, "Y": -1590, "Content": "ES8311 typical circuit separates GND(SYS) from AGND with 0 ohm; one GND net is kept until the PCB ground-strategy decision is taken.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie437", "X": 100, "Y": -1610, "Content": "Footprints, the ES8311 QFN-20 land pattern and the acoustic assembly are still not released.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie438", "X": 1000, "Y": -1410, "Content": "ES8311 Rev 5.0 package drawing shows an unnumbered exposed die-attach pad and the typical circuit labels that pad 21/PGND, while the pin table lists only 1-20; U9 keeps 20 pins until the vendor release confirms the pad and its net.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie439", "X": 1000, "Y": -1430, "Content": "PAM8302A gain is fixed by the internal 150k/10k pair at 23.5 dB. The ES8311 full-scale output is 0.4535 Vrms, so the amp clips before full codec volume; trim with the DAC volume register or add an external RIN of about 16k ohm once the acoustic target is set.", "Rotation": 0, "TextColor": null, "FontName": null, "FontSize": 5.51181, "Bold": false, "Italic": false, "UnderLine": false, "AlignMode": 4}], "polys": [{"PrimitiveId": "ie112", "Line": [990, -160, 1560, -160], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie113", "Line": [1560, -160, 1560, -290], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie114", "Line": [1560, -290, 990, -290], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie115", "Line": [990, -290, 990, -160], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie173", "Line": [1675, -155, 2245, -155], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie174", "Line": [2245, -155, 2245, -245], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie175", "Line": [2245, -245, 1675, -245], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}, {"PrimitiveId": "ie176", "Line": [1675, -245, 1675, -155], "Color": null, "FillColor": null, "LineWidth": 1, "LineType": 0}]}